@startuml
title SSHSS SysML Context
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Owner
actor "Household member" as Member
actor Installer
actor "Emergency services" as Responder

rectangle "«system»\nSentinel Smart Home Security System" as System {
  component "Central Control Unit" as CCU
  component "Sensors / Cameras / Siren" as Devices
  component "Mobile application" as App
  component "Cloud notification service" as Cloud
}
cloud "Home IP network / Internet" as Network
component "Push / SMS provider" as Provider

Owner --> App : arm, disarm, configure, review
Member --> App : operate, acknowledge
Owner --> CCU : local operation
Member --> CCU : local operation
Installer --> CCU : enroll, diagnose
Devices <--> CCU : authenticated events / commands
CCU <--> Network : encrypted IP traffic
Network <--> Cloud
App <--> Cloud : status / commands / alerts
Cloud --> Provider : notification request
Provider --> Owner : push / SMS
Owner --> Responder : human-assessed call

note bottom of System
System boundary includes local devices, app, and service.
Internet, household router, provider, and responders are external.
end note
@enduml

